  "note": "Election of five members of Portrush Urban District Council on 15 January 1924; the retirement of Miss C. E. Hamilton and Mr. R. B. Adams left five seats to be filled, and the remaining candidates were returned unopposed. Miss C. E. Hamilton, J.P., and Mr. R. B. Adams withdrew. Adams, Johnston and Seery were new members. Returned unopposed."
